{"4579770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wannabe Trashman", "steam_appid": 4579770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You're a broke, middle-aged, job-less nobody. No career, no savings, no plan. Just you and the city streets. But one day you realize something. Garbage that everyone ignores is worth more than you think.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect trash from the streets, turn it into cash, and upgrade your gear. Buy a company, expand it. Make it work and build your empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/3b626097260eb3a70a29e2767f441af7.avif?t=1776545883\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam and <strong>grab</strong> everything you can hold. Every piece of trash has some <strong>value</strong>. Fill your backpack with <strong>valuables</strong> until it's full.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/18f855f81075def67e94072e35f2ff12.poster.avif?t=1776545883\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/18f855f81075def67e94072e35f2ff12.webm?t=1776545883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/18f855f81075def67e94072e35f2ff12.mp4?t=1776545883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/06598e4872f13a290bfedb51c801018b.avif?t=1776545883\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell</strong> collected garbage to the local <strong>Pawn Shop</strong> and get money for your loot. Use it to <strong>upgrade</strong> your gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/68e4d0985642f3f97305eb5a6f6b3142.poster.avif?t=1776545883\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/68e4d0985642f3f97305eb5a6f6b3142.webm?t=1776545883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/68e4d0985642f3f97305eb5a6f6b3142.mp4?t=1776545883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/258fdcb350b5c8ce6836d5187ffdbfc2.avif?t=1776545883\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why would the public <strong>lock down</strong> containers and certain areas? Because the loot inside is worth more than you think. Just don't get <strong>caught</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/c005e6daba7b006fe3172a8577b98ab8.poster.avif?t=1776545883\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/c005e6daba7b006fe3172a8577b98ab8.webm?t=1776545883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/c005e6daba7b006fe3172a8577b98ab8.mp4?t=1776545883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/65591e197be8a39f7026cebaabe18dac.avif?t=1776545883\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've made it as a <strong>Trashman</strong>, start recruiting your own. <strong>Build</strong> a company, <strong>hire</strong> workers, <strong>manage</strong> your storage, and export <strong>processed trash</strong> for <strong>profit</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/924918061290ace9497e06f206671c05.poster.avif?t=1776545883\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/924918061290ace9497e06f206671c05.webm?t=1776545883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/924918061290ace9497e06f206671c05.mp4?t=1776545883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You're a broke, middle-aged, job-less nobody. No career, no savings, no plan. Just you and the city streets. But one day you realize something. Garbage that everyone ignores is worth more than you think.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect trash from the streets, turn it into cash, and upgrade your gear. Buy a company, expand it. Make it work and build your empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/3b626097260eb3a70a29e2767f441af7.avif?t=1776545883\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam and <strong>grab</strong> everything you can hold. Every piece of trash has some <strong>value</strong>. Fill your backpack with <strong>valuables</strong> until it's full.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/18f855f81075def67e94072e35f2ff12.poster.avif?t=1776545883\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/18f855f81075def67e94072e35f2ff12.webm?t=1776545883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/18f855f81075def67e94072e35f2ff12.mp4?t=1776545883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/06598e4872f13a290bfedb51c801018b.avif?t=1776545883\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell</strong> collected garbage to the local <strong>Pawn Shop</strong> and get money for your loot. Use it to <strong>upgrade</strong> your gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/68e4d0985642f3f97305eb5a6f6b3142.poster.avif?t=1776545883\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/68e4d0985642f3f97305eb5a6f6b3142.webm?t=1776545883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/68e4d0985642f3f97305eb5a6f6b3142.mp4?t=1776545883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/258fdcb350b5c8ce6836d5187ffdbfc2.avif?t=1776545883\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why would the public <strong>lock down</strong> containers and certain areas? Because the loot inside is worth more than you think. Just don't get <strong>caught</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/c005e6daba7b006fe3172a8577b98ab8.poster.avif?t=1776545883\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/c005e6daba7b006fe3172a8577b98ab8.webm?t=1776545883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/c005e6daba7b006fe3172a8577b98ab8.mp4?t=1776545883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/65591e197be8a39f7026cebaabe18dac.avif?t=1776545883\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've made it as a <strong>Trashman</strong>, start recruiting your own. <strong>Build</strong> a company, <strong>hire</strong> workers, <strong>manage</strong> your storage, and export <strong>processed trash</strong> for <strong>profit</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/924918061290ace9497e06f206671c05.poster.avif?t=1776545883\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/924918061290ace9497e06f206671c05.webm?t=1776545883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/extras/924918061290ace9497e06f206671c05.mp4?t=1776545883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Collect trash, sell trash, upgrade, pick locks. Become the Trashman. An open-world First-Person hustle simulator where garbage is gold. Your junk empire is just getting started.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/96de222a9f75c68ea19202ee44ae3cc9fbdf8a9f/header.jpg?t=1776545883", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/d7cfcb92a20e0f67f6cad5e939edf767ec49b2cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776545883", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579770/d7cfcb92a20e0f67f6cad5e939edf767ec49b2cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776545883", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6GB / AMD RX 580 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:<